#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /org/gnome/iagno/window-width'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:91
msgid "The width of the window"
msgstr "Breidda på vindauget"

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /org/gnome/iagno/window-width'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:93
msgid "The width of the main window in pixels."
msgstr "Breidda på hovudvindauget i pikslar."

#. see AdaptativeWindow.height-request at data/ui/adaptative-window.ui:21
#. range min="284"/ FIXME
#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /org/gnome/iagno/window-height'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:100
msgid "The height of the window"
msgstr "Høgda på vindauget"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /org/gnome/iagno/window-height'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:102
msgid "The height of the main window in pixels."
msgstr "Høgda på hovudvindauget i pikslar."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /org/gnome/iagno/window-is-maximized'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:107
msgid "A flag to enable maximized mode"
msgstr "Eit flagg for å slå på maksimert modus"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /org/gnome/iagno/window-is-maximized'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:109
msgid "If “true”, the main window starts in maximized mode."
msgstr "Viss «true», vert hovudvindauget starta i maksimert modus."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/restore-view'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:131
msgid "A flag to restore the last view"
msgstr "Eit flagg for å gjenopprette det siste visinga"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/restore-view'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:133
msgid ""
"If “true”, Dconf Editor tries at launch to navigate to the path described in "
"the “saved-view” key."
msgstr ""
"Viss «true», prøver Dconf Editor ved oppstart å navigere til stien skildra i"
" nøkkelen «saved-view»."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/saved-pathbar-path'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:138
msgid "A path to restore the pathbar state"
msgstr "Ein veg for å gjenopprette tilstanden til vegvisaren"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/saved-pathbar-path'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:140
msgid ""
"If the “restore-view” key is set to “true”, and if the path requested at "
"startup is a parent path of this one, Dconf Editor tries to restore the "
"pathbar state at this path."
msgstr ""
"Viss «restore-view»-nøkkelen er sett til «true», og viss stien som vert "
"førespurt ved oppstart er ein foreldresti til denne, prøver Dconf Editor å "
"gjenopprette stibaren sin tilstand på denne stien."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/saved-view'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:145
msgid "A path to restore the last view"
msgstr "Ein sti for å gjenopprette det siste visingsformatet"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/saved-view'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:147
msgid ""
"If the “restore-view” key is set to “true”, Dconf Editor tries at launch to "
"navigate to this path."
msgstr ""
"Viss «restore-view»-nøkkelen er sett til «true», prøver Dconf Editor ved "
"oppstart å navigere til denne stien."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/show-warning'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:152
msgid "Show initial warning"
msgstr "Vis opphavleg åtvaring"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/show-warning'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:154
msgid ""
"If “true”, Dconf Editor opens a popup when launched reminding the user to be "
"careful."
msgstr ""
"Dersom «true», opnar Dconf Editor eit popup-vindauge når det vert køyrt som "
"påminner brukaren om å vere forsiktig."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/small-keys-list-rows'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:159
msgid "A flag to enable small rows for keys list"
msgstr "Eit flagg for å slå på små rader for tastelista"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/small-keys-list-rows'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:161
msgid "If “true”, the keys list use smaller rows."
msgstr "Viss «true», brukar tastelista mindre rader."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/behaviour'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:166
msgid "Change the behaviour of a key value change request"
msgstr "Endre åtferda til ein nøkkelverdi-endringsforespørsel"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/behaviour'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:168
msgid ""
"The “unsafe” value is discouraged: for keys that have a non-special-cased "
"type, it updates the key value each time something changes in the entry, so "
"including intermediate states. The “safe” value asks for confirmation in "
"these cases, but allows instant changes for booleans and nullable booleans, "
"enums and flags. The “always-confirm-implicit” and “always-confirm-explicit” "
"values always asks for confirmation, but the first applies the change if you "
"change path whereas the second dismiss it. The “always-delay” value adds "
"each change in delay mode, allowing to apply multiple keys at once."
msgstr ""
"Verdien «unsafe» er ikkje tilrådd: for nøklar som har ein ikkje-spesiell "
"type, oppdaterer han nøkkelverdien kvar gong noko endrar seg i oppføringa, "
"og tek dermed med mellomliggande tilstandar. Verdien «safe» ber om "
"stadfesting i desse tilfella, men tillèt direkte endringar for boolske og "
"nullbare boolske, enumerasjonar og flagg. Verdiane «always-confirm-implicit»"
" og «always-confirm-explicit» ber alltid om stadfesting, men den første "
"brukar endringa dersom du endrar sti, medan den andre avviser det. Verdien "
"«always-delay» legg kvar endring til i forseinka modus, slik at fleire "
"nøklar kan brukast på ein gong."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/sort-case-sensitive'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:173
msgid "A flag to sort keys list case-sensitively"
msgstr ""
"Eit flagg for å sortere nøkkellista med omsyn til store og små bokstavar"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/sort-case-sensitive'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:175
msgid ""
"GSettings doesn’t allow keys to use upper-case in their names, but "
"installation paths of schemas can. If “true”, the keys list is sorted case-"
"sensitively, with in usual order upper-case folders first."
msgstr ""
"GSettings tillèt ikkje at nøklar har stor bokstav i namnet, men "
"installasjonsstiar for skjema kan. Om «true», vert nøkkellista sortert med "
"omsyn til store bokstavar, med dei vanlege mappene øvst først."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/mouse-use-extra-buttons'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:180
msgid "Use “Back” and “Forward” mouse button events"
msgstr "Bruk «Tilbake» og «Framover»-musknapp-hendingar"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/mouse-use-extra-buttons'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:182
msgid ""
"For users with mice that have buttons for “Forward” and “Back”, this key "
"will determine if any action is taken inside of a browser window when either "
"is pressed."
msgstr ""
"For brukarar med mus som har knappar for «Framover» og «Tilbake», vil denne "
"tasten avgjere om ei handling vert utført inni eit nettlesarvindauge når ein"
" av dei vert trykt."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/mouse-back-buttons'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:188
msgid "Mouse button to activate the “Back” command in browser window"
msgstr "Museknapp til å slå på «Tilbake»-kommandoen i lesarvindauget"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/mouse-back-buttons'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:190
msgid ""
"For users with mice that have buttons for “Forward” and “Back”, this key "
"will set which button activates the “Back” command in a browser window. "
"Possible values range between 6 and 14."
msgstr ""
"Denne nøkkelen er for brukarar med mus som har eigne knappar for «Framover» "
"og «Tilbake» og vil definere kva for knapp som slår på «Tilbake»-kommandoen "
"i lesarvindauget. Moglege verdiar er mellom 6 og 14."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/mouse-forward-buttons'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:196
msgid "Mouse button to activate the “Forward” command in browser window"
msgstr "Museknapp til å slå på «Framover»-kommandoen i lesarvindauget"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/mouse-forward-buttons'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:198
msgid ""
"For users with mice that have buttons for “Forward” and “Back”, this key "
"will set which button activates the “Forward” command in a browser window. "
"Possible values range between 6 and 14."
msgstr ""
"Denne nøkkelen er for brukarar med mus som har eigne knappar for «Framover» "
"og «Tilbake» og vil definere kva for knapp som slår på «Framover»-kommandoen"
" i lesarvindauget. Moglege verdiar er mellom 6 og 14."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/refresh-settings-schema-source'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:203
msgid "A flag to check for added or removed schemas"
msgstr "Eit flagg for å sjekke om skjema er lagt til eller fjerna"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/refresh-settings-schema-source'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:205
msgid ""
"Dconf Editor can monitor if schemas are added or removed from the multiple "
"possible locations. That’s done by checking every three seconds if the "
"schemas list has changed. As this way to do is suboptimal, this function can "
"be disabled by setting this flag to “false”. Note that this option will be "
"removed when a better way to do things is found."
msgstr ""
"Dconf Editor kan overvake om skjema vert lagde til eller fjerna frå dei "
"fleire moglege plasseringane. Dette vert gjort ved å sjekke kvart tredje "
"sekund om skjema-lista har endra seg. Sidan denne måten å gjere det på ikkje"
" er optimal, kan denne funksjonen slåast av ved å setje dette flagget til "
"«false». Ver merksam på at dette alternativet vert fjerna når ein betre måte"
" å gjere ting på vert funnen."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-schemas-enabled-mappings'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:210
msgid "Enabled relocatable schema mapping facilities"
msgstr "Slår på flyttbar schema-mappling"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-schemas-enabled-mappings'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:212
msgid ""
"Flags for the relocatable schemas mapping facilities. “User” enables "
"mappings defined by the “relocatable-schemas-user-paths” key; “Built-in” "
"enables well-known mappings hardcoded into Dconf Editor; “Internal” is "
"reserved for Dconf Editor own mappings; “Startup” is for mapping a "
"relocatable schema from the command-line."
msgstr ""
"Flagg for flyttbare skjemakoplingar. «Brukartilpassa» slår på kartleggingar "
"definert av nøkkelen «relocatable-schemas-user-paths»; «Innebygd» slår på "
"velkjende kartleggingar som er hardkoda i Dconf-redigeringa; «Internt» er "
"reservert for Dconf-redigeringa sine eigne kartleggingar; «Oppstart» er for "
"å kartleggje eit flyttbart skjema frå kommandolinja."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-schemas-user-paths'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:217
msgid "Mapping of paths to manually associated schemas"
msgstr "Kartlegging av stiar til manuelt knytte skjema"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-schemas-user-paths'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:219
msgid ""
"A dictionary that maps schema IDs with path specifications. It is used to "
"allow the user to associate a relocatable schema to certain paths. Path "
"specifications may contain wildcards in the form of empty segments (e.g. /ca/"
"desrt/dconf-editor//), defining possibly multiple paths. The same schema ID "
"may be associated with multiple path specifications."
msgstr ""
"Ei ordbok som koplar skjema-ID-ar med stispesifikasjonar. Han vert nytta for"
" at brukaren kan kople eit flyttbart skjema til visse stiar. "
"Stispesifikasjonar kan innehalde villkort i form av tomme segment (t.d. "
"/ca/desrt/dconf-editor//), og definerer dermed moglegvis fleire stiar. Same "
"skjema-ID kan vere knytt til fleire stispesifikasjonar."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/use-shortpaths'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:224
msgid "A flag for skipping unnecessary subfolders"
msgstr "Eit flagg for å hoppe over unødvendige undermapper"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/use-shortpaths'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:226
msgid ""
"When a folder only contains one subfolder and no keys, Dconf Editor can jump "
"to that subfolder directly. This flag enables that behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Når ei mappe berre inneheld ei undermappe og ingen nøklar, kan Dconf Editor "
"hoppe direkte til den undermappa. Dette flagget slår på den åtferda."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/bookmarks'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:233
msgid "A list of bookmarked paths"
msgstr "Ei liste over bokmerka stiar"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/bookmarks'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:235
msgid "Contains all paths bookmarked by the user as an array of strings."
msgstr "Inneheld alle stiar bokmerkt av brukaren som eit array av strengar."

#. Translators: summary of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/small-bookmarks-rows'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:240
msgid "A flag to enable small rows for bookmarks list"
msgstr "Eit flagg for å slå på små rader for bokmerkelista"

#. Translators: description of a settings key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/small-bookmarks-rows'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:242
msgid "If “true”, the bookmarks list use smaller rows."
msgstr "Viss «true», brukar bokmerkelista mindre rader."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/boolean'
#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/relocatable/boolean' (with default /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-* settings)
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:268
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:480
msgid "A boolean, type ‘b’"
msgstr "Ein boolsk, type «b»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/boolean'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:270
msgid "Booleans can only take two values, “true” or “false”."
msgstr "Boolske verdiar kan berre ta to verdiar, «true» eller «false»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/boolean-nullable'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:275
msgid "A nullable boolean, type ‘mb’"
msgstr "Ein valfri boolsk, type «mb»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/boolean-nullable'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:277
msgid ""
"GSettings allows nullable types, that are similar to other types but could "
"take a “nothing” value. A nullable boolean can only take three values, "
"“true”, “false” and “nothing”."
msgstr ""
"GSettings tillèt nullbare typar, som liknar på andre typar, men som kan ha "
"verdien «nothing». Ein nullbar boolsk verdi kan berre ha tre verdiar: "
"«true», «false» og «nothing»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/byte'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:282
msgid "A byte (unsigned), type ‘y’"
msgstr "Ein byte (u-teikna), type 'y'"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/byte'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:284
msgid ""
"A byte value is an integer between 0 and 255. It may be used to pass around "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Ein byteverdi er eit heiltal mellom 0 og 255. Han kan brukast til å sende "
"rundt teikn."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/bytestring'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:289
msgid "A bytestring, type ‘ay’"
msgstr "Ein bytestreng, type «ay»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/bytestring'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:291
msgid ""
"The bytestring type is commonly used to pass around strings that may not be "
"valid utf8. In that case, the convention is that the nul terminator "
"character should be included as the last character in the array."
msgstr ""
"Bytestring-typen vert ofte brukt til å sende rundt strengar som kanskje "
"ikkje er gyldige utf8. I det tilfellet er konvensjonen at null-terminatoren "
"skal vere med som det siste teiknet i arrayet."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/bytestring-array'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:296
msgid "A bytestring array, type ‘aay’"
msgstr "Ein byte-streng-array, type ‘aay’"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/bytestring-array'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:298
msgid ""
"This is the type of an array of bytestrings. The bytestring type is commonly "
"used to pass around strings that may not be valid utf8."
msgstr ""
"Dette er typen for ein array av bytestring. Bytestring-typen vert ofte brukt"
" til å sende rundt strengar som kanskje ikkje er gyldig utf8."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-handle'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:303
msgid "A D-Bus handle type, type ‘h’"
msgstr "Ein D-Bus-handtertype, type «h»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-handle'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:305
msgid ""
"The handle type is a 32-bit signed integer value that is, by convention, "
"used as an index into an array of file descriptors that are sent alongside a "
"D-Bus message. If you are not interacting with D-Bus, then there is no "
"reason to make use of this type."
msgstr ""
"Handteringstypen er ein 32-bits signert heiltal som som fast regel vert "
"brukt som ein indeks inn i ei matrise med filhandtakarar som vert sendt "
"saman med ei D-Bus-melding. Dersom du ikkje samhandlar med D-Bus, er det "
"ingen grunn til å bruke denne typen."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-object-path'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:310
msgid "A D-Bus object path, type ‘o’"
msgstr "Ein D-Bus-objektsti, type «o»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-object-path'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:312
msgid ""
"An object path is used to identify D-Bus objects at a given destination on "
"the bus. If you are not interacting with D-Bus, then there is no reason to "
"make use of this type."
msgstr ""
"Ein objektsti vert nytta til å identifisere D-Bus-objekt på ein gjeven tenar"
" på bussen. Dersom du ikkje samhandlar med D-Bus, er det ingen grunn til å "
"bruke denne typen."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-object-path-array'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:317
msgid "A D-Bus object path array, type ‘ao’"
msgstr "Ein D-Bus-objektsti-matrise, type ‘ao’"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-object-path-array'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:319
msgid ""
"An object path array could contain any number of object paths (including "
"none: “[]”). If you are not interacting with D-Bus, then there is no reason "
"to make use of this type."
msgstr ""
"Eit objektsti-array kan innehalde kva tal som helst av objektstiar "
"(inkludert ingen: «[]»). Om du ikkje samhandlar med D-Bus, er det ingen "
"grunn til å bruke denne typen."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-signature'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:324
msgid "A D-Bus signature, type ‘g’"
msgstr "Ein D-Bus-signatur, type «g»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dbus-signature'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:326
msgid ""
"A D-Bus signature is a string used as type signature for a D-Bus method or "
"message. If you are not interacting with D-Bus, then there is no reason to "
"make use of this type."
msgstr ""
"Ein D-Bus-signatur er ein streng som vert nytta som typsignatur for ein "
"D-Bus-metode eller melding. Om du ikkje samhandlar med D-Bus, er det ingen "
"grunn til å bruke denne typen."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dict-entry'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:331
msgid "A dictionary entry of type ‘{ss}’"
msgstr "Oppslagsord av typen «{ss}»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dict-entry'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:333
msgid ""
"A dictionary maps values of a basic type to another value (of any type). A "
"dictionary entry is one such mapping."
msgstr ""
"Ei ordbok kartlegg verdiar av ein grunnleggjande type til ein annan verdi "
"(av kva type som helst). Eit ordbokinnslag er ei slik kartlegging."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dictionary'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:338
msgid "A “vardict”, type ‘a{sv}’"
msgstr "«vardict», type ‘a{sv}’"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/dictionary'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:340
msgid ""
"A dictionary maps values of a basic type to another value (of any type). One "
"simple use case is to map strings to variants."
msgstr ""
"Ei ordbok kartlegg verdiar av ein grunnleggjande type til ein annan verdi "
"(av kva type som helst). Eit enkelt brukstilfelle er å kartleggje strengar "
"til variantar."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/double'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:345
msgid "A double, type ‘d’"
msgstr "Ein dobbel, type «d»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/double'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:347
msgid "A double value could represent any real number."
msgstr "Ein dobbel verdi kan representere eit kva som helst reelt tal."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/enumeration'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:352
msgid "A 5-choices enumeration"
msgstr "Ei oppramsing med 5 val"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/enumeration'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:354
msgid ""
"Enumerations could be done either with the “enum” attribute, or with a "
"“choices” tag."
msgstr ""
"Opprammingar kan gjerast anten med «enum»-attributtet, eller med eit "
"«choices»-tagg."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/flags'
#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/relocatable/flags' (with default /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-* settings)
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:359
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:494
msgid "Flags: choose-colors-you-love"
msgstr "Flagg: vel fargar du elskar"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/flags'
#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/relocatable/flags' (with default /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-* settings)
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:361
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:496
msgid "Flags could be set by the “enum” attribute."
msgstr "Flagg kan setjast med «enum»-attributtet."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-16-signed'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:366
msgid "A short integer, type ‘n’"
msgstr "Eit kort heiltal, type «n»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-16-signed'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:368
msgid "A 16-bit signed integer. See also the “integer-16-unsigned” key."
msgstr "Eit 16-bit signert heiltal. Sjå òg nøkkelen «integer-16-unsigned»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-16-unsigned'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:373
msgid "An unsigned short integer, type ‘q’"
msgstr "Eit umerkt kortvilt tal, type «q»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-16-unsigned'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:375
msgid "A 16-bit unsigned integer. See also the “integer-16-signed” key."
msgstr "Eit 16-bit usignert heiltal. Sjå òg nøkkelen «integer-16-signed»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-32-signed'
#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/relocatable/integer' (with default /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-* settings)
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:380
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:487
msgid "An usual integer, type ‘i’"
msgstr "Eit vanleg heiltal, type «i»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-32-signed'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:382
msgid "A 32-bit signed integer. See also the “integer-32-unsigned” key."
msgstr "Eit 32-bit signert heiltal. Sjå òg nøkkelen «integer-32-unsigned»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-32-unsigned'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:387
msgid "An unsigned usual integer, type ‘u’"
msgstr "Eit usignert vanleg heiltal, type «u»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-32-unsigned'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:389
msgid "A 32-bit unsigned integer. See also the “integer-32-signed” key."
msgstr "Eit 32-bit usignert heiltal. Sjå òg nøkkelen «integer-32-signed»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-64-signed'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:394
msgid "A long integer, type ‘x’"
msgstr "Eit langt heiltal, type «x»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-64-signed'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:396
msgid "A 64-bit signed integer. See also the “integer-64-unsigned” key."
msgstr "Eit 64-bit signert heiltal. Sjå òg nøkkelen «integer-64-unsigned»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-64-unsigned'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:401
msgid "An unsigned long integer, type ‘t’"
msgstr "Eit usignert langt heiltal, type «t»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/integer-64-unsigned'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:403
msgid "A 64-bit unsigned integer. See also the “integer-64-signed” key."
msgstr "Eit 64-bit usignert heiltal. Sjå òg nøkkelen «integer-64-signed»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/number-with-range'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:410
msgid "A number with range"
msgstr "Eit tal med område"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/number-with-range'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:412
msgid ""
"Every numeral setting (integers and unsigned integers of every type, plus "
"doubles) could be limited to a custom range of values. For example, this "
"integer could only take a value between -2 and 10."
msgstr ""
"Kvar numerisk innstilling (heiltal og umerka heiltal av kvar type, pluss "
"dobbeltpresisjon) kan avgrensast til eit tilpassa verdiområde. Til dømes kan"
" dette heiltalet berre ta ein verdi mellom -2 og 10."

#. Translators: do not forget the parenthesis, they are meaningful; summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/pair-of-integers'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:417
msgid "A custom type, here ‘(ii)’"
msgstr "Ein tilpassa type, her «(ii)»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/pair-of-integers'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:419
msgid ""
"Dconf Editor lets you edit any settings type supported by GSettings, falling "
"back on a string entry when it doesn’t have a better way to do. Here is a "
"tuple of two 32-bit signed integers."
msgstr ""
"Dconf Editor let deg redigere alle innstillingar som støttast av GSettings, "
"og brukar strengoppføring som reserveløysing når det ikkje finst betre "
"alternativ. Dette er eit tuppel med to 32-bitte teikna heiltal."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/string'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:424
msgid "A string, type ‘s’"
msgstr "Ein streng, type «s»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/string'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:426
msgid ""
"The string type could accept any utf8 string. Note that an empty string “''” "
"is not the same as NULL (nothing); see also the “string-nullable” key."
msgstr ""
"String-typen kan ta imot kva utf8-streng som helst. Merk at ein tom streng "
"«''» ikkje er det same som NULL (ingenting); sjå òg nøkkelen «string-"
"nullable»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/string-array'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:431
msgid "A string array, type ‘as’"
msgstr "Eit streng-array, type «as»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/string-array'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:433
msgid ""
"A string array contains any number of strings of whatever length. It may be "
"an empty array, “[]”."
msgstr ""
"Ein strengmatrise inneheld kva tal som helst av strengar med kva lengd som "
"helst. Det kan vere ei tom matrise, «[]»."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/string-nullable'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:438
msgid "A nullable string, type ‘ms’"
msgstr "Ein nullbar streng, type «ms»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/string-nullable'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:440
msgid ""
"GSettings allows nullable types, that are similar to other types but could "
"take a “nothing” value. A nullable string can take any string as value, "
"including the empty string “''”, or can be NULL (nothing)."
msgstr ""
"GSettings tillèt nullbare typar, som liknar på andre typar, men som kan ha "
"verdien «nothing». Ein nullbar streng kan ha kva streng som helst som verdi,"
" medrekna den tomme strengen «''», eller han kan vere NULL (nothing)."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/variant'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:445
msgid "A variant, type ‘v’"
msgstr "Ein variant, type «v»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/variant'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:447
msgid ""
"Variants could be stored inside variants, and consequently as a GSettings "
"type. Their representation use the XML brackets (‘<’ and ‘>’ characters, in "
"a gschema file “&#60;” and “&#62;” respectively), with a parsable "
"representation of their content inside. If unclear, the type can be given in "
"the value with a prefix annotation like “@x” (where “x” is the type string) "
"or “int64”. See https://docs.gtk.org/glib/gvariant-text-format.html for "
"complete documentation."
msgstr ""
"Variantar kan lagrast inni variantar, og dermed som ein GSettings-type. "
"Representasjonen deira nyttar XML-klammene (teikna «<» og «» i ei gschema-"
"fil «&#60;» og «&#62;»), med ein tolkbar representasjon av innhaldet inni. "
"Om det er uklart, kan typen opplysast i verdien med ein prefiks-merknad som "
"«@x» (der «x» er typestrengen) eller «int64». Sjå "
"https://docs.gtk.org/glib/gvariant-text-format.html for fullstendig "
"dokumentasjon."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/weird-enum'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:452
msgid "A 1-choice enumeration"
msgstr "Eit 1-val-oppslag"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/weird-enum'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:454
msgid ""
"An enumeration could contain only one item, but that’s probably an error. "
"Dconf Editor warns you in that case."
msgstr ""
"Ein enumerasjon kan berre innehalde eitt element, men det er sannsynlegvis "
"ein feil. Dconf Editor åtvarar deg i det tilfellet."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/weird-range'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:460
msgid "A 1-choice integer value"
msgstr "Eit heiltal med 1 val"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/weird-range'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:462
msgid ""
"A range could limit an integer key to only allow one value, but that’s "
"probably an error. Dconf Editor warns you in that case."
msgstr ""
"Eit område kan avgrense ein heiltalsnøkkel til å berre tillate éin verdi, "
"men det er truleg ein feil. Dconf Editor åtvarar deg i det tilfellet."

#. Translators: summary of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/weird-triv'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:467
msgid "The empty tuple, type and value “()”"
msgstr "Den tomme tuppelen, type og verdi «()»"

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/weird-triv'
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:469
msgid ""
"There’s an empty tuple type (called sometimes “triv”) that is a tuple with "
"no content, and can only take “()” as value."
msgstr ""
"Det finst ein tom tuppeltype (kalla «triv» av og til) som er ein tuppel utan"
" innhald, og som berre kan ta «()» som verdi."

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/relocatable/boolean' (with default /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-* settings)
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:482
msgid "An usual boolean value, defined by a relocatable schema."
msgstr "Ein vanleg boolsk verdi, definert av eit flyttbart skjema."

#. Translators: description of a demo key, see 'dconf-editor /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/Demo/relocatable/integer' (with default /ca/desrt/dconf-editor/relocatable-* settings)
#: editor/ca.desrt.dconf-editor.gschema.xml:489
msgid "A 32-bit signed integer, defined by a relocatable schema."
